  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="63a0404a-60e8-5af6-9989-0f0ae91275a3" activityNameId="33096c8a-bc24-53bf-91a1-5225076e7213" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, high pressure, at consumer</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, high pressure, at consumer
Infrastructure requirements are based on estimated standard capacity. The net calorific value of natural gas is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=32377ffb-5bda-4ae0-b426-f959624c87bd
This dataset describes the structure of the Chinese gas mix with regard to the countries of origin and the energy requirements and the emissions of the high pressure distribution network.
Location: Energy requirements and emissions are based on Swiss data. Calculations include production and transport of natural gas from 17 countries.
Technology: The quantity of gas delivered in the high pressure network is estimated. Industry, power plants and half of commercial and of other sectors are assumed to consume high pressure gas.
Time period: Energy requirements are from 2019 and leakage data are from 2018. Trade movements investigated for 2023.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature. Online calculators for distances.The consumption mix is calculated based on international trade statistics for 2023.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_32377ffb-5bda-4ae0-b426-f959624c87bd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3142d8e2-0d30-557e-b090-9faae2b72357" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CN</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Energy requirements and emissions are based on Swiss data. Calculations include production and transport of natural gas from 17 countries.</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: The quantity of gas delivered in the high pressure network is estimated. Industry, power plants and half of commercial and of other sectors are assumed to consume high pressure gas.</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2023-01-01" endDate="2024-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Time period: Energy requirements are from 2019 and leakage data are from 2018. Trade movements investigated for 2023.</text>
